#18300
The Knights of Krynn~
I originally obtained this area from Genna, one of the founders of
Our Place. She obtained the area of the internet, from Jason Huang's
web site by the looks. The author hasn't put his name anywhere conspicuous,
but I'm guessing his name may have been Sartes since the area was called
"Sartes Knights of Krynn" before I changed it.
Vex '98
~
183 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#18301
The Edge of the Drawbridge~
    You stand on the edge of this huge drawbridge. Charred, rotted,
and missing boards make crossing the ravine impossible. There is a
narrow path leading down the side of the ravine to what looks like
a small camp of Knights.
