#18330
Bonin's Room~
    You stand in a holy man's room. A bed lies against one wall.
It's sheets spotless, and clean. Opposite the bed lies a small
personal altar. Candles burn smokelessly there. Holy symbols of the
neutral god Telva, cover the walls. A small chest lies near the
bed. You get a feeling of peace when you enter the room.
~
