Vrignaud's Room~
    You stand in a mage's room. A small, unkempt bed lies against
one wall. Bookcases line the walls. Volume after volume of books
line the bookcases. Some are books of magic, while other are books
on poetry. Small vials and bottles clutter a table. The vials are
full of spell components.
~
