Saekow's house~
   You stand in a warrior's house. A large bed lies pushed off into
one corner. A large man dressed in steel plate armor, stands in the
middle of the room. He has his back to you. He is going through a
complex combat system. His sword and shield whirling and slashing.
He looks like he could crush all the Solamnia Knights personally.
~
