#18364
Underground Passage~
   You stand in an underground passage. The walls of the passage
are roughly ten feet high and probably fifteen feet wide. The walls
are very roughly cut. The floor and ceiling are as jagged as the
walls. A luminescent glowing moss grows on the walls. Strange
noises echo through the passage. Here and there you see well gnawed
on bones. Eyes look at you from ahead.
~
