Throne~
    You stand before a massive wooden throne. Dragons and roses
have been carefully carved into the wood. A small dias lifts the
throne above the floor. Dust covers everything. A white glow starts
to show around the throne. A spectre starts to form in the chair.
It takes the form of Galoe. The spectre of the once great knight of
the rose, stands up. He points to a note he is holding. He
indicates you should read it.
~
