E
Note~
The note reads:
   My name is Galoe. In life I was a knight of solamnia. I was more
than just a knight. I was a knight of the rose. This castle was my
ancestral home. 15 years ago, a young knight named Wret came to me.
He had just earned his knighthood. We learned to trust him, and had
faith in him. He turned out to be a minor Dragon Highlord. He let
his army in while we slept, and they slew us. We now roam this room
waiting for revenge. If you can kill Wret, we will be freed. So we
can ascend to sit beside Paladine.
~
S
