   You stand in the lord's bedroom. A large bed dominates the east
side of the room. A mirror sits on the west wall. Under the mirror
sits a set of drawers. Near the set of drawers is a fireplace. The
north wall is dominated by a tapestry. A man stands talking to an
image of a five headed dragon. At your entrance, the dragon screams
that you'll never stop her return. The man advances on you. 
~
