#18618
Mountain Trail~
   You stand on a mountain trail. Steep sided mountains surround
you. The trail is wide enough for 2 people to walk abreast. Loose
gravel covers the trail. You must be careful when you move, or you
could fall. Large rocks also overhang on the trail. The danger of
a rock slide is very high. Large wyverns, eagles fly above you.
Once and a while one will plunge to earth. Lynxes watch you from
the shadows. A sign sits here.
~
