Bone Chair Room~
   You have stumbled into a room. Black walls rise around you. A
chair made from many different bones takes shape before you. In the
chair lounges a beautiful woman. Anger fills her eyes. "You have
dared to stop me. Now you shall die!", screams the woman. Her forms
starts to meld, and soon a five headed dragon stands in her place.
Takhsis attacks!!
~
