Treasure Room~
You stand in a treasure room.  Piles of coins and objects surround you.  
Suddenly a misty image of Paladine drifts out of one of the shimmering wall
surfaces . "When you are done, one of these portals will take you out of this
place but choose wisely for only one will take you home.  Thanks for your help.
" He then steps through a portal and is gone.    
~
